  r97,"shared-output-authoring-surface-passes-schema-validation","","workflow YAML 包含 `workflow.resources.books` 且不包含已移除的 workflow-level 写入 intents","schema-only 校验 MUST 通过",true
  r339,"identity-without-write-defaults",workflow YAML 仅声明 books id/variant/path,配合 builtin 或 Python BookWritePolicy 运行,共享资源生命周期 MUST 正常 create/write/commit,true
  r461,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
