  r616,"append-policy-from-python","Python BookWritePolicy(mode=append,header_policy=once)",两 runs 写入同一 book 同一 sheet,最终 sheet MUST 按 append 语义合并且 YAML 无需 write_defaults,true
  r665,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
