  r255,"publish-overwrites-final-path-on-success",workflow 成功结束且存在 staged output,执行 publish,最终导出路径 MUST 被原子覆盖为 staged output 的内容,true
  r262,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r262,"worker-threads-do-not-mutate-workflow-managed-state",workflow 启用并发执行（`max_concurrency=2`）,两个 demand nodes 并发运行并产生 outputs,系统 MUST 仅在 controller 上下文中发布 artifacts/ctx/resource 写入,true
  r269,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r269,"worker-misuse-of-in-memory-discard-helpers-fails-fast",workflow 启用并发执行（`max_concurrency > 1`）,"worker 线程调用 `WorkflowArtifactsDirectory` 的 in-memory discard/cleanup helper","调用 MUST fail-fast(例如抛出 `RuntimeError`),而不是静默写入共享状态",true
  r379,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r379,"refactor-does-not-introduce-unguarded-helper-writes","",新增 artifacts helper API 或重构既有 helper,"任一会写 workflow-managed artifacts 的 helper MUST 包含相同的 owner-thread enforcement",true
  r385,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r385,"concurrent-workflows-publish-to-the-same-root-without-mutual",两个独立 workflow 进程并发写入同一输出 root（`./out`）,两个 workflow 都成功完成 publish,`./out/versions/<wf_exec_id_1>/` 与 `./out/versions/<wf_exec_id_2>/` MUST 同时存在,true
  r389,"field-id-alignment-preserves-data-under-duplicate-display-headers",workflow 输出声明 header_fields_output_by=name 且多个字段共用相同展示名(例如多个指标块共用「人数」「金额」),"workflow write 节点消费 workflow-managed 中间工件并导出 xlsx/csv","导出的每条数据行 MUST 按 field_id 位置正确取值,后续同名列 MUST NOT 被首列值填充;表头行 MUST 输出可重复的展示名",true
  r389,"export-header-decoupled-from-alignment-key","workflow-managed 中间工件的 header 为唯一 field_id 且 export_header 携带可重复展示名",写入节点执行字段对齐并写出表头行,列对齐映射 MUST 基于 field_id 不得坍缩;表头行 MUST 使用 export_header 而非 field_id,true
  r393,"xlsx-rows-preserve-naive-datetime","workflow-managed xlsx output contains naive datetime create_datetime",run completes and workbook is committed,Excel cell MUST be a date/datetime value (not a stringified text cell due to InMemoryRows str fallback),true
  r393,"xlsx-rows-aware-datetime-fails-like-openpyxl","workflow-managed xlsx output contains timezone-aware datetime",write/commit path runs,system MUST NOT stringify; failure MUST be consistent with openpyxl timezone TypeError,true
  r393,"xlsx-rows-bus-accepts-np-datetime64","workflow-managed path materializes InMemoryRows containing np.datetime64",ROWS capture completes,ROWS MUST retain np.datetime64; any failure MUST occur at Excel sink/precheck rather than ROWS gate,true
  r24,"rows-plan-skips-eager-csv-copy",a ROWS `ManagedArtifactPlan` holds 100k rows × 9 cols,`_collect_managed_artifact_outputs` runs,no CSV copy MUST be created for that plan; only the rows artifact is published,true
  r24,"csv-plan-still-emits-csv",a CSV `ManagedArtifactPlan` targets a csv/file output,`_collect_managed_artifact_outputs` runs,the CSV artifact MUST still be produced as before,true
  r25,"workbook-apply-materializes-typed-rows",`apply_workbook_sheet` receives `InMemoryRows` with int/float/bool/None,apply completes,the workbook sheet segment MUST own materialized `FieldValue` rows (not a live CSV reference SSOT),true
  r25,"workbook-commit-writes-owned-typed-rows",a workbook plan has materialized typed segments,commit writes openpyxl,`ws.append` MUST receive the owned typed values after `escape_excel_formula` on strings only,true
  r25,"workbook-still-accepts-incsv-adapter",`apply_workbook_sheet` receives `InMemoryCsv`,apply+commit succeed,"behavior MUST remain valid; cell values MAY be strings because the adapter input was CSV-equivalent",true
  r26,"release-after-final-write-consumer",某 managed ROWS artifact 仅被一个 write node 消费且无下游 book_sheet_rows 依赖,该 write node 成功 apply 到 book plan,系统 MUST 释放该 demand 侧内存 artifact,true
  r26,"release-after-commit-or-discard",workflow 结束并完成 commit_all 或 discard_all,资源生命周期收尾完成,系统 MUST 释放 plan segment 行数据占用或丢弃 plan,true
  r26,"book-sheet-rows-visibility-preserved",下游 node 仍依赖 book_sheet_rows 读取某 producer 写入的 sheet,上游 write 已 apply 但下游尚未读取,系统 MUST NOT 因过早释放 plan 导致可见性破坏,true
  r27,"yaml-residual-budget-fail-fast",YAML resources.books 下残留 budget 字段,用户执行 validate 或解析,"系统 MUST fail-fast 并提示删除该字段（不得再指向 BookBudgetPolicy）",true
  r27,"no-python-book-budget-api","","调用方尝试构造或传入 BookBudgetPolicy / BookResourcePolicy(budget=...)",该 API MUST 不可用（类型/参数不存在）,true
  r27,"pathless-writes-without-cell-sheet-budget",pathless book 未配置任何 cell/sheet 预算,workflow 写入多 sheet / 多 cell,"系统 MUST NOT 因已移除的 max_sheets/max_total_cells 护栏 fail-fast",true